# Compiled output accidentally committed alongside libs/*/src TypeScript
# sources in the past (Node/ts-node resolve .js before .ts, so a stale
# compiled file silently shadows edits to its .ts source). Do not commit
# compiled output here — libs/*/src should contain .ts sources only.
libs/*/src/**/*.js
libs/*/src/**/*.js.map
libs/*/src/**/*.d.ts
